      "props": {
        "content": "**Main read:** the vault tells a clean three-year arc: from ~60 km lifetime volume and a “maybe marathon in 12 months” note to a **3:20 marathon** and a **sub-90 half**. The standout signal is not just faster PRs — it is **running economy**: half-marathon pace moved from 5:30/km to 4:13/km while race HR stayed in the same hard-aerobic/threshold band.\n\nScope: local Obsidian notes, Garmin-style exports, race reports, lab physiology, and health/training context. Published with full biomarker detail approved, but without personal address/DOB identifiers."
      }
    },
